          "text": "The final paired batch provided evidence for the full-projection candidate: accuracy rose from 3/32 to 10/32, with 7 rescues and no losses. Six rescues were completed, correctly reasoned answers; one was scored correct despite a cutoff. Across both batches, accuracy rose from 8/64 to 15/64, and completed-correct answers from 7 to 13. I\u2019ll retain this candidate, while noting that repetition remains common and the first batch showed no net gain.",
